privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/2327a823578a30f09068f97272598521896d5633), it works as expected. Code looks good to me (aside of the stylistic changes I requested).\r\n\r\n**Testing projects:**\r\n\r\n- [test_pr_112896_no_nesting.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25498157/test_pr_112896_no_nesting.zip)\r\n- [test_pr_112896_moderate_nesting.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25498155/test_pr_112896_moderate_nesting.zip)\r\n- [test_pr_112896_heavy_nesting.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25498156/test_pr_112896_heavy_nesting.zip)\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 43)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing release optimized export template builds (`production=yes lto=full`). The time here is the best time out of 10 iterations:\r\n\r\nScene tree with 64 children and no nesting:\r\n\r\nBefore | After | Relative\r\n-|-|-\r\n629 ms | 331 ms | 1.90× faster\r\n\r\nScene tree with 64 children and moderate levels of nesting (represents a realistic scenario):\r\n\r\nBefore | After | Relative\r\n-|-|-\r\n736 ms | 338 ms | 2.18× faster\r\n\r\nScene tree with 64 children and heavy nesting (every child is nested, there are no siblings):\r\n\r\nBefore | After | Relative\r\n-|-|-\r\n1828 ms | 344 ms | 5.32× faster\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112896#pullrequestreview-3842966148","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112896","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112896#pullrequestreview-3842966148"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112896"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-23T19:14:16Z","commit_id":null}]